invalid type: string "=== HOW TO ORDER ===\n1. Browse catalog at stepaheadpk.netlify.app\n2. WhatsApp the product name and size\n3. Confirm payment\n4. We dispatch within 24 hours and send tracking number.\n\n=== FAQ ===\nQ: Can I try before buying?\nA: Yes, walk-in to our Gulistan-e-Johar store anytime during store hours.\n\nQ: Are products original?\nA: Yes, 100% original with brand warranty.\n4